OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'We're spending Christmas rowing
OL,4,Athe Atlantic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair, who play rugby for Claverdon
OL,7,FLions, are due to set off on December
OL,8,F12 from La Gomera. They expect to take
OL,9,Fup to 65 days to get to the finish
OL,10,Fline, raising money along the way for
OL,11,Fmental health charity Looseheadz.
OL,13,FNealon said: "We're not trying to make
OL,14,Fout this is heroic, no one's forcing us
OL,15,Fto do this...[it] is two mates going on
OL,16,Fa heck of an adventure. But as part of
OL,17,Fthat we want to [also] remind people to
OL,18,Fcheck in with their mates."
